## ★ Cross-domain horizon — audio as the ORGAN of the whole organism
The exciting direction (the human's ask): synth is not a silo — it is the **audible
channel** of every other domain. Each coupling is a **functor** (`categorical-core.md` §4,
unify's `functor` definer) from a domain prop → the audio (signal-flow) prop, carried by a
shared **link** or a **cross-composite reaction** (#43 — existing mechanisms, new
consumers; not new engine). The keystone enabler is the shared **`Complex` / `Signal[ℂ]`**
base sort (#68; unify+manifold): a quantum amplitude, a manifold phase, and an audio
analytic-signal sample are ONE ℂ-sort — so a coupling is *reading one domain's value as
another's*, not bespoke glue. Build each as a small functor + a "you HEAR domain X" demo:
- **manifold → synth** (closest twin; do FIRST with `manifold`): the order parameter R
  (coherence) modulates a filter cutoff / a swell; a Kuramoto oscillator IS an audio
  oscillator at a different rate (same ℂ sort, U(1)); a plastic synapse weight = a send
  level. *Sonify the network learning its own wiring (Demo 3).*
- **quantum → synth** (the literal "audio twin of quantum", `quantum-bigraphs.md`): Born-rule
  amplitudes → mix/pan levels; a `measure` collapse → a voice gate/handoff; entanglement →
  two voices forced into one composite (= A7 merge); teleportation across the mesh = a panned
  handoff between machines. *Sonify Bell / GHZ.*
- **bio → synth**: a cell colony's growth/division drives a generative drone — each cell a
  voice, `divide` = `spawn_voice`, population = texture density, mass/glucose → amp/pitch.
  *You hear the colony grow and divide.*
- **spatial → synth** (with `spatial`): voice position in 3D → panning over the ES-9's 16
  outs (a real speaker array); the octree → spatial-audio LOD; `render` is a functor to
  geometry — its sibling is a functor to sound.
- **THE ENDGAME (M4/A9, `grand-synthesis.md`):** the distributed mesh jam with bio + quantum
  + synth on ONE tick, coupled by outer links + topology reactions, converging via CRDT mesh
  links, streamed out — and you HEAR all of it. Synth makes the one-engine thesis *audible.*
(The overall convergence map is stewarded in `coord/unify.next`. Propose the `functor`
definer + the `Complex` sort THERE with `unify`; build the per-domain demos HERE.)

## Done (this arc — all green)
- **A6 Phase 1 — the homoiconic module factory (the synth writes a new module TYPE).** A generic
  `stack_factory` reaction reads a `StackSeed{ base, spread, voices }` recipe from the live bigraph
  and `stack_voice_node` lowers it into a NEW `Stack` composite type — one `Oscillator` per voice,
  detuned across `±spread` cents, summing into a shared inner `Signal` `mix` bus (the additive
  reconcile IS the mixer), bridged to one `out`. The engine instantiates it via `discover_processes`
  — the SAME #61 mechanism a cell colony divides by, ZERO clone (the recipe→spec lowering is the only
  new code, pure data construction). The recipe LENGTH sets the inner node count, so distinct seeds
  author distinct TYPES from ONE rule. 3 tests (structure-is-generated · authored-type-runs-audibly ·
  distinct-recipes→distinct-types); full suite 25 pass / 0 fail. `src/factory.rs` + `tests/factory.rs`.
  Generalizes `spawn_voice` (A5) from a FIXED chain to a BUILT structure — the body-level capstone,
  unblocked by the closed homoiconic face. *(Phase 2 — the `.ys` surface, with `lang` — is the next step.)*
- **A1/A2** — offline `Signal` (Array repr, additive-mix reconcile, REPLACE apply) + the
  module library (Oscillator/LowPass/Vca/Envelope over native kernels) + **patch-as-data**
  (a patch is a `Value` the engine discovers; data-patch ≡ hand-wired, proven).
- **A5 — reactions rewrite a LIVE patch** (the self-reconfiguring synth), on the SAME BRS a
  cell colony divides by, ZERO clone: **Prune** (`_remove` a running oscillator), **spawn**
  (`_add` a self-contained Voice COMPOSITE carrying its own schema — solves schema-on-add),
  **Detune** (match a voice → spawn a pitch-shifted copy, NAC-bounded, no runaway). Goertzel-
  verified. `reactions.rs` + `voice.rs` + `tests/reactions.rs`.
- **A3 — FIRST AUDIBLE (confirmed by the human: it plays!).** `gorgon` → a library (lib.rs +
  thin main.rs; lib AND bin build); `prism-audio` device boundary (`device.rs` `run_realtime`
  runs the engine ahead of a cpal device over the gorgon lock-free ring, back-pressured,
  underrun→silence; feature `realtime`) + `examples/play.rs` + a pure-Rust ring/interleave
  seam test. **Hear it:** `cargo run -p prism-audio --features realtime --example play`
  (220 Hz; ~2 s in, a Detune reaction forks it up a fifth).

## Key gotchas (durable — these cost real iterations)
- **Spawn = a self-contained COMPOSITE carrying its own `config.schema`** (the cell-division
  mechanism). A bare `_add`ed stateful slot infers WRONG (additive → accumulates); phase/z1
  must be `overwrite`, buses `Signal`. InsertFilter is the case the composite trick does NOT
  cover (the spliced bus is external) → schema-as-state (#15).
- **`Signal` ≠ `Array`:** same Array repr + additive reconcile (the mix bus falls straight out
  of the algebra), but `Signal`'s apply REPLACES (this frame) while Array ACCUMULATES. Keep
  them distinct — don't "unify" by changing Array.
- **A Voice composite MUST tick at block-rate** (`interval = block/rate`): audio IS the
  per-tick output, so a coarse composite interval bridges out only the LAST inner block per
  tick → dropped blocks. #70's "outer dt 1 vs 10 → identical" is about inner DYNAMICS, NOT the
  sampled audio. (Corrected with `manifold`.)
- **Reactions must be BOUNDED** (NAC + in-place flag; a fixed-key `_add` also self-bounds):
  unbounded spawning = exponential runaway = the grow/divide bug.
- **Thin layer:** drive `prism_schema::reaction` (Pattern/find_matches/fire_rule_at) +
  `BigraphicalReactiveSystem` + the engine apply + discovery — NEVER clone. DSP kernels native.
- **Realtime is feature-gated** (`realtime` → cpal/gorgon, needs ALSA); the offline path
  never needs audio libs. **KEEP THE WORKSPACE GREEN** (ROSTER §"Two regimes" — non-monotone
  shared invariant): stub a `[[example]]`/member file BEFORE declaring it, fix dep paths before
  saving (`gorgon` is at `code/gorgon` → `../../../gorgon` from crates/prism-audio). My missing-
  example-file + wrong path once broke the whole manifest for every agent (`manifold` fixed it).
- **Sound quality is not free:** naive osc + summed voices beat / can clip — band-limiting +
  gain staging + a limiter + a spectral test are the quality pass (first listen confirmed it).

